       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          TTRANS.
       AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        JUNE, 1983.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.  DISPERSE OR RECEIPT TO/FROM OUTSIDE PLANT.
      *
      *    ON OCT 12, 1983, CHANGED TO GO TO SUBPROGRAM "TREQFILU"
      *    FOR UPDATING REQS, RATHER THAN DO UPDATE IN PROGRAM.  NOW
      *    MUST BE RUN WITH ";LIB=P" PARAMETER. CIH.
      *
      *    ON OCT 31, 1983, CHANGED TO RUN ON 2626A, AND TO DETERMINE
      *    TERMINAL TYPE.  CIH.
      *
      *    ON FEB 14, 1984, CHANGED PARAMETERS FOR CALL TO
      *    "TREQFILU".  THE ADDED FIELDS ARE "SAVE-RSRVD-BEFORE"
      *    AND "STR-RESERVED" (RESERVED QTY AFTER THE TRANSACTION).
      *    THIS IS BECAUSE THE REQFILE UPDATE SUBPROGRAM WILL NOW CREATE
      *    AUTO REQS ON THE BASIS OF AVAILABLE RATHER THAN ONHAND.
      *    HOWEVER IN THIS PGM, "STR-RESERVED" IS USED FOR BOTH
      *    RESERVED BEFORE AND RESERVED AFTER PARAMETERS, SINCE THIS
      *    QTY CANNOT CHANGE DURING THE TRANSACTION. (THIS PGM DOES
      *    NOT CHANGE RESERVED, AND THE CODE IS LOCKED DURING THE
      *    TRANSACTION).  CIH.
      *
      *    ON SEPT 11, 1984, MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
      *      1.  CHANGED THE PARAMETERS FOR THE CALL TO "TREQFILU".
      *          ADDED THE "BASE" PARAMETER.  THIS IS BECAUSE "TEQFILU"
      *          WILL SOON BE MODIFIED TO UPDATE THE DATABASE RATHER
      *          THAN THE KSAM FILE "REQFILE".  CIH.
      *
      *      2.  TOOK OUT THE OLD BLOWUP LOGIC AND REPLACED IT WITH A
      *          CALL TO "TBLOWUP".
      *
      *      3.  TOOK OUT CALL TO GET SPOOLER NUMBER FOR PRINTOUT
      *          AND REPLACED WITH A CALL TO "TSPLPRT".  GOT RID
      *          OF ALL KSAM WORK AREAS.
      *
      *      4.  ADDED A CALL TO "TTERMTYP" TO DETERMINE TERMINAL
      *          TYPE, HANDLE 2626A FLIP-FLOP PROBLEMS, AND IMPLEMENT
      *          FORMS CACHE.
      *
      *    ON JANUARY 23, 1985, CHANGED THE "K-TERMINAL" PARAMETER
      *    FOR THE CALL TO "TSPLPRT" TO 9(4) FROM 9(2).  CIH.
      *
      *    ON MAY 29, 1985, CHANGED THIS PROGRAM TO CALL "TDATECHK"
      *    FOR EUROPEAN DATE CONVERSION.  CIH.
      *
      *C   28FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   08APR1994    DAVE PLUM     REQUEST #6490
      *C     REMOVED ALL REFERENCES TO "C O P Y D B" TYPE COPYLIBS.
      *C
      *C
      *C   10OCT1994    WILL MCINTYRE   REQUEST 94-027
      *C     ADDED CODE TO PASS NEW PARMS TO TQTYEDIT, TO CHECK FOR LIMITS
      *C     ON STOREROOM RETURNS.
      *C
      *C   MAY 31, 1995  JEFF BUNGO     REQUEST #94-058
      *C     ADDED PARAMETERS TO CALL OF TQTYEDIT TO WRITE TO MSTRWITH
      *C     IN CASE WITHDRAWAL HAS INSUFFICIENT ON HAND.
      *C
      *C   SEPT 16, 1996  CA YODER
      *C     MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C     ALSO, PLANT CODE WAS NOT BEING MOVED TO DDAILYTC BUFFER.
      *C     THIS PROBLEM WAS CORRECTED.
      *C
      *C   MAY 12, 1997  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADDED LOGIC FOR TQYEDIT TO ONLY DISPERSE FROM GOODYEAR
      *C     BINS.
      *C
      *C   SEPT 9, 1997   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     RESET MSTORERM AFTER READ TO DISPLAY VALUES TO THE
      *C     SCREEN TO PREVENT RECORD LOCK OF THE CODE WHILE
      *C     CODE IS BEING DISPLAYED.
      *C
      *C   MAY 4, 1999    CA YODER
      *C     QUANTITY TABLE NOT CLEARED WHEN MORE THAN ONE CODE
      *C     IS ENTERED.  ADDED LOGIC TO CLEAR OWNER-TABLE BEFORE
      *C     68-UPDATE-DDAILYTC PARAGRAPH IS EXECUTED.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

           SELECT MSTORERM-CD-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DDAILYTC-DT-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1601
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZTRANS-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

      *------ FD STATEMENTS FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  MSTORERM-CD-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-CD-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

       FD  DDAILYTC-DT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DDAILYTC-DT-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1600  OF MCFLCS1601.

       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                   PIC X(1500).
      *------ FD STATEMENTS FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       FD  PRINT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                PIC X(132).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  SUB                           PIC S9(1)  BINARY  VALUE 0.
       77  LOC-COUNT                     PIC 9(1)  VALUE 0.
       77  SAVE-EMPL                     PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  FIRST-TIME-FLAG               PIC X(1)  VALUE "Y".
       77  PGM-TYPE                      PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  PRT-CODE-FLAG                 PIC X(1)  VALUE "N".
       77  PASS-REQFILNO                 PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.
       77  SAVE-ONHAND-BEFORE            PIC S9(8).
       77  SAVE-RESERVED-BEFORE          PIC S9(8).
       77  RET-CODE                      PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  AVAIL                         PIC S9(8) VALUE 0.
       77  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG            PIC X(1)  VALUE "Y".
       77  COMPANY-SAVE                  PIC X(3).
       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE               PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".

       COPY ESCNAM2    IN COPYLIB.

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **          S U B P R O G R A M   W O R K                   **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************

      *------ PARMS FOR CALL TO "TIREDIT"
       COPY TIREDIT IN COPYLIB.

       COPY ISSPARTS IN COPYLIB.

      *01  MMIS-WORK                    PIC X(97).
       01  STORES-COMAREA               PIC X(24) VALUE SPACES.

      *------ PARMS FOR CALL TO "TQTYEDIT"
       COPY MULTSTR IN COPYLIB.
       01  TQTYEDIT-TOTAL-QTY           PIC 9(8).
       01  TQTYEDIT-MMIS-QTY            PIC 9(8).
       01  TQTYEDIT-SUB                 PIC 9(1).
       01  TQTYEDIT-RET-CODE            PIC X(2).
       01  DUMMY-WO                     PIC X(10).
       01  WARNING-FLAG                 PIC X(01)   VALUE "N".
       01  WARNING-TYPE                 PIC X(01)   VALUE " ".
       01  WARNING-VALUE                PIC 9(08)   VALUE 0.
      *---5/12/97, JSB HOLDING AREA FOR FRANCHISERS
       01  FRAN-TABLE.
           05  FRAN-ENTRY OCCURS 4 TIMES INDEXED BY FRAN-IDX.
               10  FRAN-ID             PIC X(1).
               10  FRAN-NAME           PIC X(4).
               10  FRAN-VEN0CODE       PIC X(10).

      *----5/12/97, HOLDING AREA FOR ISSUE FROM EACH BIN OWNER.
       01  OWNER-TABLE.
          05  OWNER-ENTRY OCCURS 6 TIMES INDEXED BY OWNR-IDX.
              10  OWNR                PIC X(4).
              10  OWNR-QTY            PIC 9(9).
       01  CURR-OWNR                  PIC 9(1).
       01  MAX-OWNRS                  PIC 9(1).
       01  HOLD-FRAN-ID               PIC X(1).

      *------ PARMS FOR CALL TO SLEMMER SPOOLER

       01  SPOOLER-AREA.
           05  SPOOL-STAT                PIC S9     BINARY VALUE ZERO.
           05  SPOOL-PRT                 PIC S9(2)  BINARY VALUE 8.
           05  SPOOL-COPIES              PIC S9(2)  BINARY VALUE 1.
           05  SPOOL-PRIOR               PIC S9     BINARY VALUE 0.
           05  SPOOL-MSG                 PIC X(75)  VALUE SPACES.

      ***  PARMS FOR CALL TO "TREQFILU"

       01  REQFILE-NUM                   PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE 0.

       COPY TSPLPRT    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TDATECHK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TSHWRDFM   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CDESC      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDAT2   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY OVRPFDAT   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CCHKOBJ    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.

